*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% PPD for HP DesignJet 1050C (C6074A, E-size/36in) via native
*% HP-GL/2 + HP RTL, wrapped in PJL. Confirmed by direct SNMP query of
*% the printer (hpicPrinter MIB): COMMAND SET: PML,MLC,PJL,HP-GL,HP-GL/2,RTL
*% No PCL, no PostScript on this unit.
*%
*% Raster pages are converted by the "rastertohpgl2rtl" CUPS filter into
*% a PJL job wrapper + HP-GL/2 prologue + HP RTL raster block (24-bit
*% direct-by-pixel RGB, TIFF-Packbits compressed), per the HP-GL/2 and
*% HP RTL Reference Guide (5961-3526).
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.3.1"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "HPDJ1050.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(DesignJet 1050C)"
*ModelName: "HP DesignJet 1050C HP-GL2+RTL"
*ShortNickName: "HP DesignJet 1050C RTL"
*NickName: "HP DesignJet 1050C, HP-GL/2+RTL"
*PSVersion: "(none) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "0"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: None
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 1050
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/octet-stream 0 /Library/Printers/HPDesignJet1050C/rastertohpgl2rtl"

