*% Margins measured on the hardware with a ruler print, not taken from
*% the datasheet: 5 mm sides, 12 mm top, 15 mm bottom on cut sheet with
*% @PJL SET MARGINS=SMALLER. HP's published figure of 17 mm leading and
*% trailing is the conservative/roll case and cost usable page area.
*% Note the device does not clip content that falls outside its top
*% margin - it shifts the whole image down instead, so getting the top
*% value right is what stops the bottom running off the sheet.
*DefaultImageableArea: ARCHD
